  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added parameter-bound request overloads for GET (list and by-id) and DELETE — MapGetRequest / MapGetByIdRequest / MapDeleteRequest<TEntity, TDto, TRequest>. The MediatR request binds its route/query parameters directly via [AsParameters], so no factory delegate (and no IRepository or mapping in the IApi) is needed; this scales to any number of route parameters. The list overload returns List<TDto> (pass the item DTO). Also fixed the XML doc on the list-returning MapGetRequest overload (it returns a list, not a single entity). POST/PUT are unchanged (their payload comes from the body). No breaking changes.",
